title: "llm-architecture-eval: a controlled comparison of LLM systems-architecture design"
abstract: >-
  A dataset and analysis comparing how multiple frontier large language models respond to one
  identical, evidence-demanding systems-architecture prompt: designing a 24/7 autonomous AI
  development-and-research workstation for a 32 GB Apple M6 Mac mini. Each response is captured
  verbatim, extracted into a structured decision matrix, and audited for fabricated tools, stale
  recommendations, hardware-constraint violations, internal contradictions, and citation quality.
type: dataset
